# Product rules

- v1 audience: **anyone who accepts bookings** (general hosts) in **Turkey** — Turkey-first, TR+EN. Dietitian-only is superseded.
- Languages: **Turkish** default; **English** switchable in the header and settings.
- Reference UX: Calendly-like comfortable booking — not an EHR.
- Web application first; keep backend/API suitable for a future iOS app.
- **MVP-must before invites:** Google + Microsoft calendar sync (busy + write). Apple / iCloud after iOS.
- **Never** store health/clinical patient data. Before new form fields or DB columns, check `docs/legal/DATA-CLASSIFICATION.md`.
- **No marketplace** discovery unless `docs/DECISIONS.md` / PRD says so. No payments until owner gate.
- Prefer updating `docs/process/SESSION-HANDOFF.md` after meaningful work.
- Resolve open product questions via `docs/product/OPEN-QUESTIONS.md` → `docs/DECISIONS.md`.
